---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import StatusBadge from '../components/StatusBadge.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="오류 해결 가이드" section="TROUBLESHOOTING">
  <div class="page-shell troubleshooting-page">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="page-kicker">TROUBLESHOOTING · QUICK REFERENCE</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">오류 해결<br />가이드</h1>
      <p class="lead">증상, 가능한 원인, 확인 순서, 해결 방법을 일관된 형식으로 제공하기 위한 기본 구조입니다.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="diagnosis" aria-labelledby="diagnosis-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span>01</span>
        <h2 id="diagnosis-title">증상으로 찾기</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="issue-list">
        {[1, 2, 3, 4].map((item) => (
          <details>
            <summary>
              <span>ISSUE {String(item).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
              <strong>오류 항목 검토 예정</strong>
              <StatusBadge status="검증 필요" />
            </summary>
            <div>
              <p><b>가능한 원인</b> 승인된 원인 정보가 이 위치에 표시됩니다.</p>
              <p><b>확인 순서</b> 검토된 점검 단계가 이 위치에 표시됩니다.</p>
              <p><b>해결 방법</b> 출처와 함께 승인된 해결 방법이 표시됩니다.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .page-intro { margin-bottom: 6rem; }
  .issue-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--line-dark); }
  details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dark); }
  summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr auto;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem 0.5rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary::after { content: "+"; grid-column: 4; font-size: 1.6rem; }
  details[open] summary::after { content: "−"; }
  summary > span { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
  summary strong { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.25rem; }
  details > div { padding: 0 1rem 2rem 8.5rem; color: var(--muted); }
  details > div p { margin: 0.4rem 0; }
  details > div b { display: inline-block; min-width: 7rem; color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
    summary > span { grid-column: 1; }
    summary strong { grid-column: 1; }
    summary :global(.status-badge) { grid-column: 1; justify-self: start; }
    summary::after { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / 4; }
    details > div { padding-left: 1rem; }
    details > div b { display: block; }
  }
</style>
